	(text "R11 (D-R11-05): J9 is a latching JST GH SM06B-GHS-TB 6-pin header: pins 1 and 2 CAM_5V, 3 and 4 GND, 5 CAM_RX_WIRE (board RX), 6 CAM_TX_WIRE (board TX); the 1 A camera allowance is 0.5 A per contact (GH 1.0 A per contact, JST eGH p1). Camera U12/U13 isolation and the U402 switch retained."
